### Sarcasm (direction only)

{% sample title="Clip 3 · Sarcasm (direction only)" %}
**Text:** Thanks for updating the spreadsheet. I can tell you put a lot of care into it.

**Listen for:** Plain should sound sincere. Directed should mean the opposite of the words.

**Direction, as prose:** Dry, cutting sarcasm. The speaker is annoyed and means the opposite of every word. Lean on 'a lot of care'.
