### Anger held in check

{% sample title="Clip 5 · Anger held in check" %}
**Text:** I asked for the report on Monday. It's Thursday. I'm going to need it by the end of today.

**Listen for:** Plain: firm, a little annoyed. Directed: quiet, clipped fury, no shouting.

**Direction, as prose:** Barely contained fury: quiet, clipped, every word deliberate. Do not shout.
{% /sample %}

- {% model name="gpt-4o-mini-tts (2025-03-20)" vendor="openai" /%} **Plain.**

